target: skills/review/review-loop/review-stats.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./review-stats.test.sh
expect: an abandoned run is counted again against each of its gates
why:    an abandoned run has every planned gate unreported by construction, so counting it per gate as well turns one event into nine gate failures — which is how three gates crossed the alarm threshold with no real miss between them
--- old
            counts["(run abandoned)"] += 1
            continue
--- new
            counts["(run abandoned)"] += 1
